Localisation:
{if:SF.IsMythic}{c_mythic}{/if}Your Evade transforms you into an angry Lunatic for up to {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 1"]{/c} seconds that explodes dealing {c_important}Command Fallen's{/c} Base damage and you gain {if:SF.IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_1 * 100|%x|]{/c} increased {c_important}Command Fallen{/c} damage every second you are transformed.

While you are an angry Lunatic, your Movement speed is increased by {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 0"|x%|]{/c} and you periodically spawn a Mini Lunatic that seeks enemies. 

{c_important}Command Fallen{/c} deals {if:SF.IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_1*100|x%|]{/c} increased damage.{if:SF.IsMythic}{/c_mythic}{/if}

{if:SF.IsMythic}{c_mythic}{/if}Dealing direct damage grants {if:SF.IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_1|2%x|]{/c} increased Critical Strike Damage for each enemy hit within {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 0"]{/c} seconds, up to {if:SF.IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix."Static Value 2" * Affix_Value_1|%x|]{/c}.

At Maximum you gain:

{c_label}Lucky Hit:{/c} Critical Strikes have up to a {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 1"|%|]{/c} chance to deal double damage, Heal for {if:SF.IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_2]{/c} Life, and refresh the duration of the bonus.{if:SF.IsMythic}{/c_mythic}{/if}

{if:SF.IsMythic}{c_mythic}{/if}{icon:bullet,1.2}Gain {if:SF.IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_1*100|x%|]{/c} bonus Poisoning damage.
{icon:bullet,1.2}Direct damage from {c_important}Werewolf{/c} Skills gain a bonus equal to {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 0"*100|x%|]{/c} of your bonus Poisoning damage, up to {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 2"*100|x%|]{/c}.
{icon:bullet,1.2}Poison damage from Werewolf Skills gain a bonus equal to {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 1"*100|x%|]{/c} of your bonus Attack Speed and Critical Strike Chance, up to {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 2"*100|x%|]{/c}. 

Current Direct Damage bonus: {c_number}[min((Owner.DOT_DPS_Bonus_Percent+Owner.DOT_DPS_Bonus_Percent_Per_Damage_Type#Poison +Owner.Bucketed_Multiplicative_DoT_Damage)*Affix."Static Value 0"*100, Affix."Static Value 2" * 100)|%x|]{/c}
Current Poison Damage bonus: {c_number}[max(0,min((Owner.Attack_Speed_Percent_Bonus_Total+Owner.Cast_Speed_Percent_Bonus+Owner.Crit_Percent_Base+Owner.Crit_Percent_Bonus)*Affix."Static Value 1"*100, Affix."Static Value 2" * 100))|x%|]{/c}{if:SF.IsMythic}{/c_mythic}{/if}

{if:SF.IsMythic}{c_mythic}{/if}{c_label}Lucky Hit:{/c} Dealing damage to an enemy affected by a {c_important}Trap{/c} Skill has up to a {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 0"|%|]{/c} chance to:
{icon:bullet,1.2} Reduce the active Cooldowns of your {c_important}Trap{/c} Skills by {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 1"|%|]{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2} Increase your {c_important}Trap{/c} Skill damage by {if:SF.IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_1|1x%|]{/c} for {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 2"]{/c} seconds, up to {c_number}[Affix_Value_1*Affix."Static Value 3"|x%|]{/c}{if:SF.IsMythic}{/c_mythic}{/if}
